-### Changes to Existing Files
-
-| File | Change |
-|------|--------|
-| `server/services/chat_service.py` | **Rewrite**: Remove all subprocess logic. Keep `build_prompt()` as static (backward compat). Delegate streaming to `ProviderRouter`. |
